'''Ryder's camp''', known previously as '''Vizago's camp''', was the [[Lothal]] base of operations of the [[Devaronian]] [[crime lord]] [[Cikatro Vizago]] and his [[Broken Horn Syndicate]], and later the [[Lothal resistance group]]. The camp was located in a [[stone circle]], and was in use in the years prior to the [[Battle of Yavin]].

